### Szybkie testy ręczne (rozszerzenie REST Client w VS Code)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = wklej-accessToken-z-logowania

### Rejestracja
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mateusz", "email": "mateusz@test.pl", "password": "haslo12345" }

### Logowanie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mateusz", "password": "haslo12345" }

### Ja
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rozgrywki
GET {{baseUrl}}/competitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nowa liga (Liga Mistrzów + Premier League)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leagues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Znajomi", "competitionIds": [1, 2] }

### Moje ligi
GET {{baseUrl}}/leagues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Terminarz ligi z moimi typami
GET {{baseUrl}}/leagues/1/fixtures?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Typ na mecz
PUT {{baseUrl}}/leagues/1/matches/4/prediction
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 2, "awayScore": 1 }

### Tabela ligi
GET {{baseUrl}}/leagues/1/leaderboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
